      369.67,
      286.44,
      438.8
    ],
    "text": "Ref No.: WA/18/84/2011/11. I hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the Government intends to acquired the following lands which are required for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
