    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      441.21,
      288.84,
      559.52
    ],
    "text": "The land allotments of land described below in total extend of 0.5040 Hectares, shown as 1 and 2 in the preliminary plan dated 2016.05.12 for Gam 3992 prepared by the Surveyor General situated in village of Nawammahara, the Ragam Paththuwa Minor Division in the Divisional secretary\u2019s Division of Wattala in the District of Gampaha, in Western Province and bouned as follows.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
