    "text": "Name of the land: Kajugahakumbura; Descriptionn: Open Wasteland; Claimant: Abdul Gafoor Anas, No.10, Hamsa Lane, Muthuwela Mawatha, Colombo - 15; Original Claimant:\u2014; Extent: about 0.4020 Hectare.",
