  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      305.04,
      330.56,
      587.6,
      444.08
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid lands are hereby required to appear personally or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretary\u2019s Office, on the 31st day of October 2016 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 31st day of October 2016, the nature of their interests in the land the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
